{"id":"n63922-1-5","stage":4,"title":"손꼽다 · 掐指","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63922-1-5-1","ko":"뭘 그렇게 손꼽으며 세고 있어?","zh":"你在那儿数手指头算什么呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손꼽으며","meaning":"掐指，扳着指头","explanation":"손꼽다：掐指，扳着指头；으며：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"손꼽다","audio":"/audio/09222bac9a27f717eeb1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63922","senseId":"1","lemma":"손꼽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"세고","meaning":"数","explanation":"세다：数；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"세다","audio":"/audio/98e8ee1f7a1fe33460bc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49075","senseId":"1","lemma":"세다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"09222bac9a27f717","term":"손꼽다","zh":"掐指，扳着指头","audio":"/audio/09222bac9a27f717eeb1.mp3","entryId":"63922","definition":"一个一个弯着手指数数。","pronunciation":["손꼽따"]},{"id":"98e8ee1f7a1fe334","term":"세다","zh":"数","audio":"/audio/98e8ee1f7a1fe33460bc.mp3","entryId":"49075","definition":"记算数量。","pronunciation":["세ː다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/0bcf341dd0137b1d2e20.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63922-1-5-2","ko":"어머니 생신이 며칠 남았는지 헤아려 봤어.","zh":"我在算妈妈生日还有几天。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머니","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생신이","meaning":"寿辰，诞辰，生日","explanation":"생신：寿辰，诞辰，生日；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"생신","audio":"/audio/17bf3766fa611ae9c913.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16595","senseId":"1","lemma":"생신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"며칠","meaning":"几天","explanation":"며칠：几天","readings":[{"term":"며칠","audio":"/audio/879abb6ed1ed4d59a03e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36676","senseId":"2","lemma":"며칠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"남았는지","meaning":"剩，剩下","explanation":"남다：剩，剩下；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"남다","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64552","senseId":"1","lemma":"남다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"헤아려","meaning":"数，计","explanation":"헤아리다：数，计；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"헤아리다","audio":"/audio/f2551564078d74c5ef19.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87000","senseId":"1","lemma":"헤아리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봤어.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"20","lemma":"보